(7648858, 1243759, 29486, '<td valign="top">I feel like this is a bit like Where''s Waldo? You have to look hard to see there is a man and dog in the picture.</td>', 'I feel like this is a bit like Where''s Waldo? You have to look hard to see there is a man and dog in the picture.', '2019-12-23 01:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648859, 1243945, 29486, '<td valign="top">I like the photo in general. The lighting is nice. Maybe because the subject is completely flush to the camera, I want him to be in total focus, i.e., more depth of field.</td>', 'I like the photo in general. The lighting is nice. Maybe because the subject is completely flush to the camera, I want him to be in total focus, i.e., more depth of field.', '2019-12-23 01:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648860, 1243998, 29486, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there is nothing appealing about this image. It''s virtually all black and the outline doesn''t capture anything unique or spectacular.</td>', 'Unfortunately there is nothing appealing about this image. It''s virtually all black and the outline doesn''t capture anything unique or spectacular.', '2019-12-23 01:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648861, 1243814, 29486, '<td valign="top">Very nice and solid. I like the muted feel.</td>', 'Very nice and solid. I like the muted feel.', '2019-12-23 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648864, 1243988, 29486, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the flowing hair. I''m not liking the lighting. The deep black around the left eye is bothering me.</td>', 'I like the idea of the flowing hair. I''m not liking the lighting. The deep black around the left eye is bothering me.', '2019-12-23 02:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648865, 1243813, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space above his head. The lighting is not flattering. The background is better lit tham the subject so he almost seems silouetted.</td>', 'Too much empty space above his head. The lighting is not flattering. The background is better lit tham the subject so he almost seems silouetted.', '2019-12-23 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648866, 1244007, 29486, '<td valign="top">Way too much blur for my liking. I''m not sure if that''s fog on his glasses or the prescription. The background is not appealing (even though it''s a dump). The post on the left drags my attention away from the subject also.</td>', 'Way too much blur for my liking. I''m not sure if that''s fog on his glasses or the prescription. The background is not appealing (even though it''s a dump). The post on the left drags my attention away from the subject also.', '2019-12-23 02:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7648867, 1243952, 29486, '<td valign="top">Well, it did say Male. I kind of expected it to be human though. :)   Other than that, it''s a nice image.</td>', 'Well, it did say Male. I kind of expected it to be human though. :)   Other than that, it''s a nice image.', '2019-12-23 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
